# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Service instances in the Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"
msgstr "Instances de service dans l'API Resource Controller {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API is a separate API. You use it to create and update service instances. If you create or update instances with this API, change the instance parameters too.\n"
msgstr "L'API IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller est une API distincte. Tu l'utilises pour créer et mettre à jour des instances de service. Si tu crées ou mets à jour des instances avec cette API, modifie aussi les paramètres de l'instance.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create or update an instance, send these parameters in the request:\n"
msgstr "Lorsque tu crées ou mets à jour une instance, envoie ces paramètres dans la requête :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Don't send | Send instead | Type of the new parameter |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| À ne pas envoyer | À envoyer à la place | Type du nouveau paramètre |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Nombre ou `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Nombre ou `null` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The parameters have these meanings:\n"
msgstr "Les paramètres ont les significations suivantes :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Instance limit**The maximum usage for the instance. If you do not send a limit on the Open Plan, the default is the RU equivalent of 10 minutes.\n"
msgstr "**Limite d'instance**L'utilisation maximale de l'instance. Si tu n'envoies pas de limite sur l'Open Plan, la valeur par défaut est l'équivalent en RU de 10 minutes.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage allocation**: The share of usage for the instance. The fair-share scheduler uses this value to set the priority of the instance in the queue. The allocation does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.\n"
msgstr "**Allocation d'utilisation** : la part d'utilisation de l'instance. L'ordonnanceur à partage équitable utilise cette valeur pour définir la priorité de l'instance dans la file d'attente. L'allocation ne s'applique pas aux instances Pay-As-You-Go.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you read an instance, the `extensions` object in the response contains the old fields and the new fields. Disregard `instance_limit_seconds` and `usage_allocation_seconds`. Read `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"
msgstr "Lorsque tu lis une instance, l'objet `extensions` de la réponse contient les anciens champs et les nouveaux champs. Ignore `instance_limit_seconds` et `usage_allocation_seconds`. Lis `instance_limit_ru` et `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information, see the [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"
msgstr "Pour plus d'informations, consulte la [documentation de l'API REST IBM Quantum Compute Service](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage analytics {#usage-analytics}"
msgstr "Analyses d'utilisation {#usage-analytics}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, and `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"
